    <briefdescription>
<para>base class for the one day deposit BBA EUR LIBOR indexes </para>    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Euro O/N LIBOR fixed by BBA. It can be also used for T/N and S/N indexes, even if such indexes do not have BBA fixing.</para><para>See <ulink url="http://www.bba.org.uk/bba/jsp/polopoly.jsp?d=225&amp;a=1414">http://www.bba.org.uk/bba/jsp/polopoly.jsp?d=225&amp;a=1414</ulink>.</para><para><xrefsect id="caveats_1_caveats000037"><xreftitle>Warning</xreftitle><xrefdescription><para>This is the rate fixed in London by BBA. Use <ref refid="class_quant_lib_1_1_eonia" kindref="compound">Eonia</ref> if you&apos;re interested in the fixing by the <ref refid="struct_quant_lib_1_1_e_c_b" kindref="compound">ECB</ref>. </para></xrefdescription></xrefsect></para>    </detaileddescription>
